    "generation_attempt_1": "\"Don't ask me,\" the tavern runner mutters, glancing nervously over his shoulder. \"People are too jumpy tonight, and no one’s saying much—at least not anywhere I can safely hear. The chatter’s mostly rumors, and it’s better not to spread them wrong.\" He shifts his weight and shakes his head. \"If you want real talk, you’d have better luck with the guard captain, but I doubt he'll be sharing freely either.\"",
